{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25839","headline":"回望馆娃故宫 · 李绅","name":"回望馆娃故宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江云断续草绵连，云隔秋波树覆烟。\n飘雪荻花铺涨渚，变霜枫叶卷平田。\n雀愁化水喧斜日，鸿怨惊风叫暮天。\n因问馆娃何所恨，破吴红脸尚开莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}